sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant M as main.ts
  participant R as Router + guards
  participant API as API
  participant P as DelayedPreloadingStrategy
  B->>M: loads index.html + main bundle
  par start in parallel
    M->>B: prefetchShellTab():<br/>shell + tab chunks
  and
    M->>R: bootstrap
    R->>API: session + household requests (guards)
  end
  API-->>R: guards pass
  opt /analytics/* only
    R->>B: load nested child page now<br/>(CategoryStatsPage or BudgetsPage)
  end
  R-->>B: render shell + tab (tab chunk already cached)
  R->>P: first navigation ends
  Note over P: waits 3000 ms
  P->>B: preload remaining lazy routes<br/>(charts, forms)
